## 3. 数据结构

### 好友关系 (Friendship)
```javascript
{
  userId: string,
  friendId: string,
  status: 'pending' | 'accepted' | 'rejected',
  createdAt: timestamp,
  acceptedAt: timestamp
}
```

### 聊天消息 (ChatMessage)
```javascript
{
  messageId: string,
  roomId: string,
  senderId: string,
  senderName: string,
  content: string,
  type: 'text' | 'phrase' | 'emoji',
  timestamp: timestamp
}
```

